title: Integration with Drawers/Configure grouping options
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

The //Group by// options are provided by a single filter: search it for `offered-members`. Each grouping option is named twice: a `...-member` line with its title above the filter, and a `...-member` run inside it.

!! Removing a grouping option

To remove a grouping option, delete its run from the filter.

For example, removing Priority leaves the filter reading:

```
offered-members={{{ [<project-member>] :filter[has[title]] :filter[<currentTiddler>addprefix[$:/config/hypergsd/GroupBy/hidden/]get[text]else[show]match[show]] +[format:titlelist[]join[ ]] }}}
```

!! Adding a grouping option

To add a grouping option, add a //Group by// tiddler's title (for example `$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/group-by/realm`) to the filter run. The first tiddler you name will be the default grouping.


As an example, adding Realms takes one line plus its run:

```
realm-member="$:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/ui/group-by/realm"
offered-members={{{ [<priority-member>] [<realm-member>] [<project-member>] :filter[has[title]] :filter[<currentTiddler>addprefix[$:/config/hypergsd/GroupBy/hidden/]get[text]else[show]match[show]] +[format:titlelist[]join[ ]] }}}
```

You can find every standard grouping option by [[searching shadow tiddlers|$:/core/ui/AdvancedSearch/Shadows]] for `ui/group-by/`.